                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Discounts Are Strongly Linked to Margin Decline</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Higher average discounts are associated with sharply lower profit margins, especially in Furniture and some Technology sub-categories. This suggests pricing strategy, not demand, is a major driver of losses. </run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
